                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} type
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \; \mathrm{type}
            and a type of sets
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Set
                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} type
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Set \; \mathrm{type}
            rather than a set judgment
            = succeed "," do
