            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/principle+of+unique+choice"} principle of unique choice
            holds.
          %p
            Applying separation to relations
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
