          %h2#related_pages_and_spinoffs Related pages and spinoffs
          %p The following pages develop various aspects of set theory in SEAR or related theories.
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+numbers+in+SEAR"}> natural numbers in SEAR
